# N1: TestRunnerAction throws TestExecException ("Test failed, aborting") without
# --test_keep_going; SkyframeErrorProcessor.rethrow rethrows it, BuildTool.processRequest reports
# it with a successful build exit code, TestCommand.doTest returns 3. (A second failing run on
# the oracle's warm server reports the target as failed to build, as the abort races with its
# completion, so the failing test runs once without --keep_going.)
run test --notest_keep_going //:fail_test
run test --notest_keep_going //:pass_test
run test --notest_keep_going --keep_going //:fail_test
